{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act15d0_level_act15d0_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act15d0",
  "stageId": "act15d0_08",
  "title": "激战之末",
  "storyCode": "MB-8",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5e4cea5f2c70d43d6b46bd698f3cfcf4039d32c5486126cd49f9db37ba1cbb18",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们真是搞出了不小的动静啊，安东尼先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是我事先没有知道你们的计划，恐怕我也拦不住你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "你就是杰斯顿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没错，正是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然在这座监狱中有过数次擦肩而过，不过请容许我重新自我介绍一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我叫做杰斯顿·威廉姆斯，是你这次越狱行动中最后的阻碍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "杜玛呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜玛",
      "speakerToken": "char_441_lotus_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_441_lotus",
      "portraitKey": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "安东尼，对不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜玛",
      "speakerToken": "char_441_lotus_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_441_lotus",
      "portraitKey": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "我在医务室等你，没想到这个人忽然带着一些囚犯进来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "杜玛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如此阴森的地方，怎么能让这样一位美丽的小姐孤单地在这里等待呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我就稍微保护了一下她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#3",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "杰斯顿先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，罗宾小姐，你似乎失败了，真是令人遗憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还是说，你根本没有执行刺杀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#6",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "她失败了，你的手下伤不了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你却留了她一命，我不得不说，你真是一名出色的绅士，安东尼先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "废话少说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也好，那就让我们直奔主题吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安东尼先生，不想这位小姐死去的话，请过来这边一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卡夫卡小姐，请你乖乖地站在那里不要动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你似乎十分擅长浑水摸鱼，希望你不要擅自做一些会伤到杜玛小姐的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "嘁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对，就站在那里就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们，围住他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜玛",
      "speakerToken": "char_441_lotus_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_441_lotus",
      "portraitKey": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "安东尼，你别听他的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "不要说话，杜玛，我会救你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "危急关头还能保持冷静，真是令人敬佩，安东尼先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你应该知道我想要干什么，你也知道我不可能会忽然动了恻隐之心放过你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的建议是，你可以考虑抛弃这位小姐，抛弃你一直以来伪装自己的教养，然后来与我厮杀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "废话，少说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你能坚持到什么时候呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然后是你，罗宾小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#3",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "诶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接下来，请你杀了安东尼先生，完成你未竟的任务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我并不在乎你在刚才与安东尼先生达成了怎样的协议，又发生了怎样的心境转变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你想获得那笔钱，如果你想救你的父亲，那么，这是你最后，也是最好的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#6",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#6",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在犹豫什么？是安东尼对你许诺了什么空头支票？还是事到如今你心软了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是你唯一的机会了，罗宾小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#6",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "我，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想想你的父亲，想想你变得一团糟的生活，想想你的未来，想想你的愿望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我是你，我不会犹豫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "你究竟想做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想做的还不明显吗？如果我只是想杀害你，在监狱之中我有许多机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但这些都太没意思了，真的，太没意思了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "杀人这件事对我来说并没有特别的乐趣，安东尼先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对我来说，最有趣的部分，是改变，是人面临抉择时不得不抛弃过去面孔的那一瞬间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我把罗宾小姐引来，渴望罗宾小姐的改变，渴望她的堕落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也渴望你的改变，渴望你此时此刻为了你的家人，为了你的目的，而抛弃一直以来的矜持，露出你的獠牙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，别装了，安东尼先生，说真的，别装了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想想你的家族，想想你受的无妄之灾，想想你的忍辱负重，想想你越狱的目标。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你真的甘心就这样死在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你真的甘心为了区区一个认识几年的女性就葬送性命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "站起来，安东尼先生，推开罗宾小姐，忘掉杜玛小姐，扑向我，然后杀害我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "别把所有人都想得和你一样，杰斯顿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别以为你与众不同，安东尼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我给你五秒钟时间，罗宾小姐，时间到的话，我就会亲自动手，而你，恐怕也不得不葬身此地了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "五。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "罗宾小姐，你父亲的手术费还差许多，而安东尼先生现在身无分文。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#6",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "安东尼，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "四。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安东尼先生，你的父母因为在监狱中受到排挤，过得非常不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......父亲，母亲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜玛",
      "speakerToken": "char_441_lotus_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_441_lotus",
      "portraitKey": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "安东尼，不要管我，你不能死在这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "囚犯A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜玛",
      "speakerToken": "char_441_lotus_1#4",
