      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "可恶，这家伙，准备得真是周全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感谢你的赞美，卡夫卡小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "你这家伙，从一开始就是在骗罗宾吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不不不，我只是一向不会只做一手准备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "罗宾小姐要是得手，那我乐得清闲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而她要是失手，你看，我也为她准备了后手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不能说我没有为她着想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "说得好听，明明是你把她卷进来的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，我从未否认我的目的是想要目睹她的挣扎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是卡夫卡小姐，你也是有自己事业的人，请好好想想，如果我没有把她卷进来，她能找到方法筹齐她父亲的医药费吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我认为可能性很低。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "嘁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看，你也无法反驳我，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "嘶......我不得不承认，罗宾......如果帮你......会更好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "但是，她没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "这，就，够，了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "吼！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "居然在这种情况下还能战斗吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也罢，就让我亲自来扑灭你最后的一点幻想吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#2",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "安东尼，我来帮你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "啧，我可没有安东尼那样的力气啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "咦......你们当心，他的手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_214_kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "他的手，变黑了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啧啧，多么温情脉脉的一幕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而一想到这一幕能由我亲自来打碎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰斯顿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就感到十分开心啊，安东尼老弟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
